    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u><strong>What is it?</strong></u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > An action RPG guiding a lone girl, summoned to a mystical world, back to her home.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3720440/extras/16a6c4247fe1ecd659ed9ca46bacb66f.avif?t=1754716378\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u><strong>Features</strong></u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Freely explore a vast semi-open world, challenging the ending from the start. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every monster drops unique gear. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Shape your character to your style through dynamic battles and crafting.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3720440/extras/2c1cefadfd2847fe98aade7c10c83ead.avif?t=1754716378\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>Additional Information</u></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game is currently in development, and the images shown are from an early stage of production. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >They may change as development progresses, but we will keep the store page updated accordingly.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u><strong>What is it?</strong></u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > An action RPG guiding a lone girl, summoned to a mystical world, back to her home.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3720440/extras/16a6c4247fe1ecd659ed9ca46bacb66f.avif?t=1754716378\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u><strong>Features</strong></u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Freely explore a vast semi-open world, challenging the ending from the start. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every monster drops unique gear. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Shape your character to your style through dynamic battles and crafting.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3720440/extras/2c1cefadfd2847fe98aade7c10c83ead.avif?t=1754716378\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>Additional Information</u></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game is currently in development, and the images shown are from an early stage of production. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >They may change as development progresses, but we will keep the store page updated accordingly.</p>",
